Key Strengths & Critical Vulnerabilities

• Strengths:
	• The business profile is indexed on Google Travel and pulls direct room pricing from OTA partners.
	• All 8 existing reviews are positive and mention cleanliness, modern decor, and comfortable amenities.
• Vulnerabilities:
	• Location SEO Mismatch: They are located in Kubwa (FO1), but market heavily as "Abuja Luxury Apartments". Guests searching for central Abuja (Maitama, Wuse, Central Business District) might book inadvertently and leave negative reviews regarding commute time.
	• Review Collection Pipeline: There is no automated prompt (SMS/WhatsApp review link or lobby QR code) pushing checked-out guests to Google, leaving their review volume stagnant.
	• Direct Booking Leakage: Because they lack their own booking website, Google routes bookers to OTAs, which take a 15–20% commission on room reservations